# OWNER: N0 — what stays out of git under Native/ (IOS-SPEC §1.1, §2.6)
# Build products and tool state: builds happen in $SCROLLS_BUILD_DIR mirrors, never here, but editors (SourceKit-LSP)
# and xcodegen can leave these behind.
.build/
.swiftpm/
Scrolls.xcodeproj/
ScrollsKit/.scrolls-targets
# Bundled packs and the starter are build products (Tools/packs.sh, N2).
Scrolls/Resources/Bundled/
# Reports are local machine-readable outputs; only the milestone records are committed (IOS-SPEC §1.1).
Reports/*
!Reports/milestones/
# The Store's mini fixture database is a committed test input (the root .gitignore drops *.sqlite); its MANIFEST.json
# says how it was made, and the test refuses a stale copy.
!ScrollsKit/Tests/ScrollsStoreTests/Fixtures/mini-dump/mini.sqlite
